'''Kintaro''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during [[Ancient Heroes ULTRA SOULS (Gacha Event)|Ancient Heroes ULTRA SOULS]] event after [[Version 9.1 Update|Version 9.1]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 10.3 Update|Version 10.3]] grants improved health, attack and the ability to [[Curse]]. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 13.6 Update|Version 13.6]].

