==Trivia==
*This unit is based off of the axe-wielding Japanese folktale hero [[wikipedia:Kintarō|Kintarō]] and the animals he was said to have befriended.
**Kintaro working for a corporation in his Normal Form and riding a motorcycle in his Evolved Form is a reference to the manga ''[[wikipedia:Salary Man Kintaro|Salary Man Kintaro]]'', whose titular protagonist is a former ''[[wikipedia:Bōsōzoku|Bōsōzoku]]'' biker.
*The kanji on Kintaro is 金 ''kin'', meaning gold.
*The word 猛銃 ''mōjū'' ("fierce gun") in Kinrangers RoboForce's Japanese name sounds like the word 猛獣 (wild animal), but is spelled using the kanji 銃 (gun) instead of 獣 (beast).
*Kinrangers RoboForce is a parody of the ''[[wikipedia:Super Sentai|Super Sentai Series]]'', otherwise known in America as the [[wikipedia:Power Rangers|Power Rangers]], which revolves around five costumed action heroes who fight villains with signature weapons, martial arts, and giant mechs.

